  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An Innovative, Integrated Approach to Enhance Smallholder Family Nutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve nutrition of an estimated 19200 vulnerable and poorest smallholder households in Mabara and Masaka districts,  by promoting the cultivation and consumption of nutrient-rich crops and improving nutrition care practices of under- 2 children, adolescents girls, and pregnant women.</narrative>
  </description>
